        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to present this spacious and well-maintained three-bedroom, two-storey semi-detached home to the rental market. Ideally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac, this excellent property offers comfortable family living with the added benefit of a private front and side garden featuring a unique gated entrance. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen complete with a new oven/grill and electric hob, a separate utility room, three generous double bedrooms and a fully tiled family bathroom with both a bath and shower. New carpets are due to be fitted prior to tenancy. \r\n\r\nAdditional features include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, a fully alarmed security system, ample parking, and high-quality appliances throughout. The property enjoys an excellent location close to Tallaght Village and Citywest Shopping Centre, with a wide selection of schools, shops, cafés, and local amenities nearby. The LUAS Red Line is within walking distance, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre, while a variety of sports clubs and recreational facilities are also close by. \r\n\r\nFeatures • Spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home • Gas-fired central heating • Double-glazed windows • Fully alarmed • Can come fully furnished or unfurnished • Fully fitted kitchen with new oven/grill and electric hob • Three double bedrooms • Fully tiled bathroom with bath and shower • Private front and side gardens with gated entrance • Ample parking • Excellent location close to Tallaght Village, Citywest Shopping Centre and the LUAS • Available to rent immediately\r\n\r\nEmail enquires only please / No phone calls"
      },
